Z||000012||terryk||07-18-2000||02:55 PM||||Gross Vehicle Weight is the max weight of the car that is allowed, it is not the weight of the car. GVW is the weight of the car + fluids + passengers + cargo that is acceptable before the manufacturer will slap you up-side the head and tell you it's too heavy.||||reg||1
